0..76 Comment "// This source shows two stated types that compare through a model slot. Two"
77..144 Comment "// modules answer the first slot, and no module answers the second."
145..147 Comment "//"
148..225 Comment "// The signature decides no model for either slot. So each slot waits for the"
226..269 Comment "// body, as it waits in any other position."
270..272 Comment "//"
273..351 Comment "// The decode of the stated type meets the slot\'s hole before the body decides"
352..430 Comment "// the slot. So the checker resolves the slot there, and the refusal names the"
431..471 Comment "// modules that answer it, or no module."
472..474 Comment "//"
475..502 Comment "// - see: #6158 — `twice`"
503..544 Comment "// - see: #6195 — `twice`, `unanswered`"
545..638 Comment "// - see: `../../model/modules/model-stated-type.gandr` — a slot that the signature decides"
